    <apiVersion>68.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <description>ALF-RS-12 (LFRDN-342) FR4/FR7 - Quick Action entry point for the already-built AF_HandoverDocumentService automated document sequence. Leaving Document Name blank generates every not-yet-complete document in the fixed BRD order (5 agreements). LFRDN-699 fix: the service&apos;s blank-name call never included Delivery Note (SEQUENCE_DOCUMENTS deliberately excludes it, per FR7), so this flow now makes a second call with Document Name = &quot;Delivery Note&quot; right after - safe to call unconditionally since the service returns a graceful Result (never throws) whether the schedule gate is met, the document is already complete, or it succeeds. This was previously invocable-only with no UI - this Quick Action is its first real button.</description>
